# Note what is *not* here: a `*.csv` rule.
#
# The old data/ folder ignored every CSV, because the dataset was not
# committed. These seven are, through Git LFS, so that rule would now
# silently drop the data this folder exists to hold. See README.md.
#
# What this ignores is the rest of what collects in a data folder.

# Intermediate output nothing downstream reads (downsampling-by-half.py).
5.1HAR_Downsampled_50Hz.csv

# Working copies of the tables.
*-copy.csv
*_copy.csv
*.csv.bak
*.csv.tmp

# Spreadsheet and archive versions of the same data, and Office lock files.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.zip
~$*

# Notebooks people keep next to the data.
.ipynb_checkpoints/
